flowchart TB
    APP[AppShell 导航与原型标识] --> ROUTER[五页路由与上下文ID]
    ROUTER --> OVERVIEW[OverviewPage]
    ROUTER --> EVIDENCE[EvidencePage]
    ROUTER --> REPAIR[VerificationPage]
    ROUTER --> AI[ExplanationPage]
    ROUTER --> REPORT[ReportPage]
    EVIDENCE --> LIST[FindingList 与搜索筛选]
    EVIDENCE --> SOURCE[SourceTabs 与脱敏证据]
    REPAIR --> OBL[ObligationChecklist 与范围说明]
    AI --> FACT[固定事实条与解释卡]
    REPORT --> PREVIEW[脱敏报告预览]
    API[类型化API客户端] --> STORE[服务端结果缓存与请求状态]
    STORE --> OVERVIEW
    STORE --> EVIDENCE
    STORE --> REPAIR
    STORE --> AI
    STORE --> REPORT
    STORE --> JOB[任务阶段 计数 取消状态]
    TOKENS[视觉Token与状态文案] --> SHARED[Badge Dialog Toast EmptyState]
    SHARED --> ROUTER
    LOCAL[页面本地状态 选择项 筛选 视角] --> ROUTER
